    kd:documentedUse "Testing: RotatE filters top-n candidates and DeepSeek-V3/V2.5 or Qwen2.5-72B re-rank them; compared with embedding, text-based, fine-tuned and training-free LLM baselines (MRR, Hits@1/3/10); ablations, LLM-scale, CoT/ICL and candidate-number analyses." ;
    kd:domain <https://w3id.org/kgdse/domain/general-no-domain> ;
    kd:evidenceLocation "Sec. 4.1, Table 1, pp. 15-16; Table 2, p. 18; Table 3, p. 19; Figs. 5-7, pp. 20-22" ;
