    kd:datasetVersionText "MusicBO corpus (part of the Polifonia Textual Corpus; 137 texts in four languages, 1700 to present; 47 English and 51 Italian documents processed) and the resulting MusicBO KG (531,073 triples from 7,557 filtered sentence-AMR pairs)" ;
    kd:documentedUse "Dataset introduction: OCR, co-reference resolution (English), post-OCR correction and sentence splitting; SPRING (EN) and USeA (IT) AMR parsing; AMR2FRED conversion to RDF/OWL named graphs; Framester alignment to DBpedia, Wikidata and VerbAtlas; AMR graphs filtered by back-translation (BLEURT for EN, cosine similarity >= 0.90 for IT)." ;
    kd:domain <https://w3id.org/kgdse/domain/cultural-heritage-and-humanities> ;
    kd:evidenceLocation "Sec. 2, pp. 213-215; Tables 1-2, pp. 213-214" ;
