    kd:datasetVersionText "DBLP-QuAD (new; 10,000 question-SPARQL pairs from 98 templates, train/valid/test 7:1:2; 13,348 creators and publications, 11 predicates; 2,350 temporal questions; 20 template tuples and 2 question templates withheld from train)" ;
    kd:documentedUse "Dataset introduction, training and testing: OVERNIGHT-style generation (template sampling, subgraph sampling, literal augmentation, filtering by executing queries on a local Virtuoso endpoint); T5-Small and T5-Base fine-tuned with gold entities and relations; exact-match accuracy 0.638 / 0.813 and answer F1 0.721 / 0.868." ;
    kd:domain <https://w3id.org/kgdse/domain/scholarly-and-education> ;
    kd:evidenceLocation "Sec. 4, Fig. 2, Table 1, PDF pp. 5-9; Sec. 4.7, Table 2, PDF p. 10; Sec. 5, Fig. 3, PDF p. 11; Table 3, PDF p. 12 (PDF pages)" ;
    kd:facet <https://w3id.org/kgdse/facet/GEN>,
        <https://w3id.org/kgdse/facet/MH> ;
    kd:fromReport <https://w3id.org/kgdse/report/B20-X04> ;
    kd:limitationDataset "questions are synthetically generated from templates written by two authors and drawn from the KG, so they may not reflect real user information need (Sec. 7, PDF pp. 11-12). about 80% of valid/test data share syntactic structure with train, which the authors call test leakage (PDF p. 12). full paper titles do not reflect how users refer to papers, an open entity-linking problem (PDF p. 12)." ;
    kd:metric "Accuracy",
        "Exact match",
        "F1" ;
    kd:pageConvention "PDF page" ;
    kd:recordStatus "active" ;
    kd:researchCategory <https://w3id.org/kgdse/category/kg-question-answering> ;
