    kd:datasetVersionText "DBLP-Citation-network V14 subset (10,000 documents published after 2010 with title, abstract and three to five author keywords)" ;
    kd:documentedUse "Training and testing: five-fold cross-validation; training folds used to set beta, omega, gamma and lambda; TP-CoGlo-TextRank (M6) compared with TF-IDF, an LDA model (trained on 48,365 DBLP documents), TextRank and two modified TextRank variants on extracting four to nine keywords per test document (AP, AR, AF1); at k = 7 with adjacent keywords combined, AF1 of M6 is 2.34% to 28.45% higher than M1-M5. Author keywords serve as the gold standard." ;
    kd:domain <https://w3id.org/kgdse/domain/scholarly-and-education> ;
    kd:evidenceLocation "Sec. 4.1, Tables 1-3, pp. 9-10; Sec. 4.3.3, p. 17; Figs. 9-12, pp. 18-21; Table 5, p. 22" ;
