    kd:documentedUse "Source corpus and dataset introduction: pipeline run on 288,118 articles produced 342,181 n-ary tuples from 201,731 sentences; n-ary relations decomposed losslessly into binary edges; top-150 extractions manually labelled (Precision@50/100/150 = 78%, 78%, 79.33%); ablation of each module on a random sample of 1,000 articles. Financial Times Lexicon used for dictionary-guided minimisation." ;
    kd:domain <https://w3id.org/kgdse/domain/business-e-commerce-and-tourism>,
        <https://w3id.org/kgdse/domain/media-and-social> ;
