    kd:scopeStudy "recall could not be measured because ground-truth facts in the corpus could not be found (fn. 7, p. 972). 94.7% of eliminated predicate-argument structures failed the financial predicate filter, so coverage depends on the 87-predicate dictionary (p. 972)." ;
