    kd:documentedUse "Dataset introduction and analysis: E-OED framework (Vietnamese SimCSE, UMAP, HDBSCAN, automatic labelling) yields 284 clusters and about 372 intents; Sentence-BERT two-stage retrieval with TF-IDF reranking links intents to policies at threshold 0.32; 53 intents receive no policy link, of which 22 are missed links." ;
    kd:domain <https://w3id.org/kgdse/domain/legal-and-public-sector>,
