    kd:documentedUse "Dataset introduction and validation: over 85 million [entity, tag, part-of-text, DOI] records extracted and cleaned; relations weighted by co-occurrence counts; entities matched to Wikidata/DBpedia; annotator disagreement measured per entity type on a random test set (e.g., 2.7% for applications, 22.03% for synthesis methods); SPARQL queries for TiO2, CdTe and graphene illustrate use; released as CSV and RDF." ;
    kd:domain <https://w3id.org/kgdse/domain/industry-engineering-and-energy> ;
    kd:evidenceLocation "Methods, pp. 2-3; Table 1 and Table 2, p. 4; Data Records, pp. 4-5; Technical validation, p. 6; Figs. 2-3, p. 7; Usage notes, p. 8" ;
