    kd:fromReport <https://w3id.org/kgdse/report/B21-Y23> ;
    kd:limitationDataset "MatKG captures connections found in the corpus, not all of materials science; some relations may not hold under scrutiny (pp. 6-7). co-occurrence does not distinguish causative from correlative relations (pp. 6-7). equivalent entities (e.g., CH4 and Methane) are not merged in the current version (p. 3)." ;
