    kd:datasetVersionText "Wikidata label-alias validation set (new; 9,793 Polish main label-alias pairs of humans with a Polish Biographical Dictionary identifier (P8172) or a 'The Great Genealogy' provenance statement, born 1264-1770; 71,000 negative pairs; balanced training subset of 625 positive and 625 negative pairs)" ;
    kd:documentedUse "Dataset construction (SPARQL) and testing: Levenshtein, normalised Levenshtein, Jaro-Winkler, Beider-Morse and Daitch-Mokotoff scored with a component-wise Dice coverage threshold (best single F2 0.676, NLEV-0.3); Random Forest and XGBoost ensembles with 5-fold CV; LaBSE fine-tuned on the 1,250-pair subset (F2 0.838) and on the full training data (F2 up to 0.912, AUC 0.986); reduced-feature Random Forest (F2 0.740)." ;
    kd:domain <https://w3id.org/kgdse/domain/cultural-heritage-and-humanities> ;
    kd:evidenceLocation "Sect. 4.1-4.6, pp. 384-393; Listing 1.1, p. 386; Tables 2-8, pp. 387-393; Fig. 4, p. 390" ;
