        <https://w3id.org/kgdse/role/testing> ;
    kd:scopeStudy "string matching is treated as an early stage; contextual Wikidata properties (birthplace, occupation, education) are deliberately not used (p. 394). no statistical significance testing of differences between ensembles and LaBSE (p. 394). LaBSE needed 45 min 42 s on two RTX A5500 GPUs vs seconds for tree models (p. 392)." ;
    kd:study <https://w3id.org/kgdse/study/B22-E26-20> ;
