    kd:datasetVersionText "CR-TKGQA (new; 31,078 questions each paired with an executable Wikidata SPARQL query: 1,076 seed, 12,168 generalised, 17,834 pattern-augmented (sum of the three types) (7,593 SEA, 7,885 TEA, 2,356 ETA); train 21,701 / dev 6,327 / test 3,050 with I.I.D., compositional and zero-shot levels)" ;
    kd:documentedUse "Dataset introduction, training and testing: three experts author seed questions over 40 temporal Wikidata predicates; generalisation by entity/literal substitution, DeepSeek-v3 paraphrasing and pattern-grounded augmentation; answers refreshed against the official Wikidata endpoint; baselines (SF-TQA, EXAQT, LoRA-fine-tuned Llama-3-8B, DirectQA, SPINACH, RTQA) evaluated with answer F1 on a 1,000-question test sample using gold linking; SPINACH best overall (43.9 F1); fine-grained analysis by taxonomy aspect." ;
    kd:domain <https://w3id.org/kgdse/domain/general-no-domain> ;
    kd:evidenceLocation "Sect. 3.1-3.2, pp. 159-164; Fig. 1, p. 153; Table 3, p. 162; Table 4, p. 163; Sect. 4, pp. 164-168; Tables 5-6, pp. 165-166" ;
