        <https://w3id.org/kgdse/role/testing>,
        <https://w3id.org/kgdse/role/training> ;
    kd:scopeStudy "all baselines use gold-standard entity and relation linking (p. 165). baselines evaluated on a random 1,000-question sample of the test set (p. 165). RTQA and the pre-LLM methods are adapted to Wikidata, which may not reflect their original performance (Table 5, p. 165). the taxonomy is categorical and interaction effects between dimensions are not analysed (p. 168)." ;
    kd:study <https://w3id.org/kgdse/study/B22-E26-9> ;
