    kd:documentedUse "Testing (use cases): KG embeddings added to task models; mobility prediction Acc@1 0.531 vs 0.442 (ARNN) in Beijing and 0.429 vs 0.379 in Shanghai (7:1:2 split by time); ablations with and without UrbanKG for user profiling and traffic generation; explainable site selection." ;
    kd:domain <https://w3id.org/kgdse/domain/geospatial-urban-and-environment> ;
