        <https://w3id.org/kgdse/role/testing> ;
    kd:scopeStudy "questions are template-generated with exact entity and relation names, so there is no lexical gap between questions and KG (p. 13). only the KBQA model is evaluated; gold topic entities and question types are assumed (pp. 12-13). no food Q&A dataset on ingredients, nutrients and recipes existed, which motivated the synthetic set (p. 11)." ;
